# The Humanities in the Schools Curriculum--Source of Enrichment and Wisdom. A &quot;Bulletin&quot; Special.

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
According to this interview, the humanities are as essential to the educational reform agenda as mathematics and science. The humanities lead us to values, to deep questions about life's meaning and dignity. Our society's diversity, coupled with the national goal to educate everyone to the best of his or her ability, makes general education a difficult task. (MLH)

